# Without this, Git guesses whether a file is text and may rewrite its line
# endings on checkout. For the PDF test fixture that is fatal: a PDF records
# byte offsets in its xref table, so turning LF into CRLF shifts every offset
# and the file stops parsing - on a fresh clone, which includes CI.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Keep shell scripts LF whatever the platform, or they fail to run.
*.sh text eol=lf
